{"id": "86275", "name": "הפרש שני קטעים כקטע – כתיבה כאי-שוויון (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><p>Express the following set as an interval:</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\left( {{CT:0}}, {{CT:1}} \\right]\\ \\backslash\\ \\left[ {{CT:2}}, 55 \\right). \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><p style=\"font-size:0.92em;margin:8px 0 0\">Note: Give your answer as an inequality such as \\( x&gt;= -7\\) and/or \\(x&lt;5\\).</p></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>\\(\\left( {{CT:0}}, {{CT:1}} \\right]\\ \\backslash\\ \\left[ {{CT:2}}, 55 \\right)\\) are all the values that are in \\(\\left( {{CT:0}}, {{CT:1}} \\right]\\) but not in \\(\\left[ {{CT:2}}, 55 \\right)\\), i.e. it is the interval \\(\\left( {{CT:0}}, {{CT:2}} \\right)\\), as \\({{CT:2}}\\) is included in the second interval.</p><p>This is entered as \\(x&gt;{{CT:0}}\\mbox{ and }x&lt;{{CT:2}}\\).</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:Result]]", "prtcorrect": "<p><span class=\"correct\">Correct answer, well done.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p><span class=\"partially\">Your answer is partially correct.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p><span class=\"incorrect\">Incorrect answer.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 2, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "answer1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-F ", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["answer1", "n1", "n2", "n3", "wronganswer1", "wronganswer2"], "nvariants": 50}